    {
      "id": "bSiMjm2gA7HaoTNV351_W",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4778.549875474737,
      "y": 3644.4183901103347,
      "width": 782.8795166015625,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b40",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 901710630,
      "version": 48,
      "versionNonce": 1577856634,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793041488792,
      "created": 1793040878256,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. **It writes a database query** against the finished, cleaned tables for that\ncustomer only. It can look things up and try a few queries, usually 2 or 3.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. **It writes a database query** against the finished, cleaned tables for that customer only. It can look things up and try a few queries, usually 2 or 3.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1THufpJEGxuYo0RUR3Q1j",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4775.132973866814,
      "y": 3720.7621277330536,
      "width": 777.699462890625,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b41",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1275243066,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 2062519846,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793041488792,
      "created": 1793040878256,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. **Every query passes a safety check before it runs:** read-only, no touching\nfiles or the internet, no runaway joins, size and time limits. The query also runs\nwith a key that can only open that one customer's data, so even a bad query\ncan't reach anyone else's.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. **Every query passes a safety check before it runs:** read-only, no touching files or the internet, no runaway joins, size and time limits. The query also runs with a key that can only open that one customer's data, so even a bad query can't reach anyone else's.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "KJEt36u8RG9wqwrK18b_K",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4769.312966542595,
      "y": 3830.7621277330536,
      "width": 766.0594482421875,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b42",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1786752614,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 406081338,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793041488792,
      "created": 1793040878256,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. **It gives an answer:** the number or table, the query it used and a short\nexplanation. If the data can't answer the question, it says so instead of\nguessing. Our system then re-runs its final query itself and shows that result,\nrather than trusting what the assistant says it got.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. **It gives an answer:** the number or table, the query it used and a short explanation. If the data can't answer the question, it says so instead of guessing. Our system then re-runs its final query itself and shows that result, rather than trusting what the assistant says it got.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
